    <bpmn:process id="W_W5546" name="W5546. BIR eFPS &amp; Government-Portal Outage Filing Contingency, AAB Fallback &amp; Penalty-Relief Documentation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: eFPS, eBIRForms, or the BIR ePayment gateway (or an SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG/LGU portal on a statutory deadline) is unavailable on, or within 3 days before, a filing/payment deadline; or the accredited CAS/e-invoicing system fails to transmit sales-invoice data for more than 4 hours during the obligation window
Frequency: ~2–6 events/yr chain-wide — portal congestion near the 10th/20th/25th deadline days is a recurring Philippine reality already cited as a pain point in the W590/W2764 filing and PA-79.1 workflows, but never owned as an event
Volume: 1 event × the affected filing calendar (monthly VAT 2550M/Q, withholding 1601-EQ/FQ, remittances, annual returns) × 5 legal entities × penalty exposure per return (25% surcharge + 20% p.a. interest + compromise penalty under the RMC 7-2015 framework)
Owner: Tax Manager
Participants: Entity Tax Specialists, Finance Controller (AAB payments), Treasury (fund positioning per W556-class timing), Corporate Secretary (records), IT &amp; CAS vendor (e-invoicing branch), external tax counsel (abatement), Compliance
Source: workflow W5546 — BIR eFPS &amp; Government-Portal Outage Filing Contingency, AAB Fallback &amp; Penalty-Relief Documentation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5546_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5546_Lane1" name="Entity Tax Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5546_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5546_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5546_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
